{"about_the_game":"Join Airia, a Bard from a small town, on a huge quest to save the World.<br />\r\nThe Legendary Instruments were stolen; Can she get them back? She can...with help. Grab your...Flute and get going! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story takes place on the planet of Pangaea where you'll travel from a small bardic farm town to a power plant (filled with robots!), to the lava world called Styx beneath the surface. Travel between 2 world maps using your airship and take down The Opus Quintet before they unlock the secrets of the instruments!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith a throwback to classic turn-based RPGs, you adventure along picking up allies along the way. Topping out at 16 recruitable characters, you'll have to manage a roster of characters each with unique passive traits and a unique selection of skills. Packed full of gear and skills, this game offers deep customization and a character class system designed to put you in control.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Soda Guzzler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2748660/39894b21fc6a457f6c910ab6ad36c47ef57d60fc.jpg"},{"name":"Missing Chemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2748660/88778cbe4d8c02c3d414281d0372fd18aac881ad.jpg"},{"name":"Musical Mayhem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2748660/1bdcce8cc68cca3167df4dd2e664b4af6edb53d7.jpg"},{"name":"Avid Reader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2748660/95207deff1ebcb06edcc22ca54863f79022d040f.jpg"},{"name":"Waste Not","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2748660/0f57b687c51709820fbe836ed90639deddab30df.jpg"},{"name":"Yawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2748660/060a141d2d3c76aa600e370fc6ae88b0f29d2802.jpg"},{"name":"Thrifty Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi